# Default-deny. Mirroring .gitignore only excludes what we thought to name,
# which leaves untracked scratch files and nested checkouts free to reach an
# image layer — and `cache.sqlite` holds the @cache store, which carries live
# bearer tokens for nine destinations. Everything is excluded, then the files
# the image actually needs are added back.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!vitest.config.ts
!vitest.setup.ts
!parksapi-entrypoint.sh
!src

# src/ is allowed wholesale above, so re-exclude what can appear inside it:
# HAR captures from `npm run har`, harness dumps, and a stray install.
**/node_modules
**/*.har
**/testout_*
**/temp*.json
**/temp*.js
